      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>We are grateful to Judy Gumbo for contributing the prayer she co-authored with Stew Albert ז״ל before his passing in 2006. Judy blogs at yippiegirl.com and can also be found on Facebook as “Yippie Girl.” She invites friendly folk to friend her via her FB page “Judy Gumbo Albert.” This <tei:hi rend="italic">Al Ḥeit</tei:hi> was most recently used as part of Yom Kippur <tei:hi rend="italic">Kol Nidre</tei:hi> services across the country in solidarity with Occupy Wall Street 5772. For more information, visit the community page of Occupy Judaism on Facebook.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
